@model Edulytics.Web.ViewModels.Onboarding.DemoLeadListViewModel
@inject IStringLocalizer<Edulytics.Web.OnboardingResource> T
@{ ViewData["Title"] = T["LeadsTitle"]; }
<section class="onboarding-admin-shell">
    <header class="onboarding-header">
        <a class="school-back-link" asp-controller="Platform" asp-action="Dashboard">← @T["BackHome"]</a>
        <p class="onboarding-eyebrow">@T["Eyebrow"]</p>
        <h1>@T["LeadsTitle"]</h1>
        <p>@T["DashboardDescription"]</p>
    </header>

    @if (TempData["OnboardingSuccess"] is string success) { <div class="alert alert-success">@success</div> }
    @if (TempData["OnboardingError"] is string error) { <div class="alert alert-danger">@error</div> }

    @if (Model.Items.Count == 0)
    {
        <div class="onboarding-card">@T["NoLeads"]</div>
    }
    else
    {
        <div class="onboarding-table-wrap">
            <table class="table onboarding-table">
                <thead><tr><th>@T["SchoolName"]</th><th>@T["ContactName"]</th><th>@T["Status"]</th><th>@T["Students"]</th><th>@T["Created"]</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                @foreach (var item in Model.Items)
                {
                    <tr>
                        <td>@item.SchoolName</td><td>@item.ContactName</td><td>@T[$"Status_{item.Status}"]</td><td>@item.EstimatedStudentCount</td><td>@item.CreatedAtUtc.ToString("u")</td>
                        <td><a asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@item.Id">@T["Open"]</a></td>
                    </tr>
                }
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    }
</section>
